    <item>
      <title>奥巴马医改削减后，医院正在治疗更多未参保的患者</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/30/business/aca-obamacare-health-insurance.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[在国会共和党人结束增强的联邦补贴后，更多失去保险的人现在正在急诊室寻求治疗，但无法支付账单。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/30/business/aca-obamacare-health-insurance.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 09:02:55 GMT</pubDate>
